      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THAT'S OKAY (1) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 300m behind Beautiful Banter (18.07) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Has ability and is a key runner. GUNNELL GIRL (2) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at this track over 300m behind Old Friends (18.22) in a Grade 5. Should be about the mark. QUEEN LOCH (3) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (17.65) at this track behind Young Energy in a Mix 2/3. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Expected to feature. CROSSED TOES (7) hit the frame here last start so don't underestimate.",
